{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1525,
  "batch_count": 1689,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "4c77e29d79c031b121c5d2d0a53ce8b0070eb9a1",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f6d2d801632138744006f61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火锅♪火锅♪……呵呵呵。\n今天和同期的大家一起吃火锅哦！\n这次要做什么装饰锅好呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1a2880b2ed66ff9bea0bb9499feea86cf3c191d5f647c169ba96b78ddc25bbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7170decfd72bb90d67b8b96d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，包和服装都没问题。\n那么……今天也两个人，\n一起走下去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d01b0f38c06435fafb35a6736b33c0c6bf3ed76ef409f9cef2e8345172a76b46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:026a926e06cc91a186060bfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能完成早上的First Look，\n真是太好了。为了光辉的未来，\n今天也一起励精图治吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "560ce69fd430a83150e1ee148cf6ac47d3ee4b274a2b52504011f38b25d8cdf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdca31b7879182d8fe01ee76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "便当，我放在桌子上了。\n营养，还有您喜欢的东西。\n装得满满当当的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b75aae79ab4c90321c66cb53c44c76f1a2294dddae8fb46dcb4e086d2b6989b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0a733d614d75af849a62549",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放学后，偶尔会去教会。\n庄严的气氛会让心平静下来。\n……穿着这件礼服就更是如此了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "585c80bc45522214c2cabc961f14f6fc40ce2a6906ab7a6873fb737075862179",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a0857b42d7cf7fd18f771db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果您累了，请把手交给我。\n就像追寻月光一样，\n我会护送您的……开玩笑的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfa8b118bf6536268caadd22d50a3a587a8fa6d7588395c619981f1606316fc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db7d952a598eab4ff042f697",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然还有在做自主训练的后辈\n……稍微去看看情况吧。\n说不定我能为她指明道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eb052c8059018959bbd16ec7231215413190b7e09e75c88b8e6f6b9883243e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c18a329d50651ff1762957c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生们的启程，吗。\n……作为构筑未来的人，\n我不由得绷紧了身心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cec13fbc87ee663df0d45f5f93fc7343c10fa715550901784a05c2a320f56b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f39c1f3513ccdb194f54e9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要勤于补充水分哦？\n特制运动饮料的话\n马上就能做好，请别客气♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3374f5c3a26355d675a5ad4a0bb61244afe5fc2acbcedbfe85e4d02ab664faa8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:156dfccf7eb68453145b0e0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铺满落叶的道路，\n简直就像婚礼甬道一样……\n走在上面感觉有点浪费。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d1735f09c0512be7308d6eef7f59f8be13152e2417324312eaaad0f58e52068",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30467aec354275c8a56f0e27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒风好强啊……。如果不介意的话，\n一起喝杯热咖啡怎么样？\n我想在身体暖和起来之前，和您聊聊天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37303d0a0a6c6f9290cc55bdc51a4840452083444c1105c27fde9ddfd87c7857",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5a7f2d411e4ed27f1dd8014",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7adcbea6443d8e50521edf37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aac7b0b9839759ac10eb3dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吉兆小姐，果然说英语的时候\n好像比平时更健谈。\n呵呵，下次聊什么好呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b17415a1f5d9fc991ce14eedb89d5e73387ea97e325e04c653ce940a8995b4c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8ce27f4e2f497d1dc94793e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和景致小姐的外出，是在车站前集合吗……\n必须早点到达才行。\n……在她为了找我而迷路之前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f4b78df1d1e32d06e28d900b749ef563163cb5b2f8c19c37d0d1ab82b0154f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99e043fe3adc1fdc3519c540",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天开了鲨鱼电影鉴赏会。\n哪条鲨鱼都很精神很可爱……\n我能明白勇心喜欢的原因了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "41098c8db3a49265f2218360163ef7adbf8becc3bb86eb482cae22412bf45767",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75046982c3847d7c0233de99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次的考试，还是没能比过救世主小姐\n……这样战绩就是五五开了。\n下次，必须要夺得领先才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5964aecd5726dfc072aa4e04014d6c1677255e93ac38f956b8f3231eb00b2842",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4bc9b55c4e78185e7f8d829",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的减脂甜点，特别周小姐\n会喜欢吗？要是能稍微\n填饱肚子就好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "babd40212ed8d03f4624c093ee2bae7c26929348dd29c4dcfc38b0284871ba12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5afacf06574103e72a5152c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对于年幼的赛马娘们来说，\n这是憧憬的服装之一……呵呵。\n能穿上它真开心啊……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d4c276d09f7c7689993896ec5ac7d8c59fc871e87c41300eb882054dce8b98f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb44435d9db4742cd50546dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从舞台上看到的景象，\n真是难以用笔墨形容……只是，\n我想回应那份光芒与狂热。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfaaa541a241d73fa59f1e7fb9959b7410ddf1b81f3bceb62ef4f670675dae35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28cdbb7f5d2e0caa4c5570ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在把手穿过外套袖子的时候，\n表情是不是会变得严肃起来？\n工作模式ON！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01ce4cad6d662775381809745c29d469058f6c4c13678574dc46d846b97608e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc1b0fa36e1ca87ce5da422e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到这抹绿色，\n就会觉得自己的存在扎下了根基……\n脊背也会挺直。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdf351d89c30c42004ad54c6f9e79ee0fbc877db5429812931ddd272df0b8516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15b9f07cf84502cacc7c75c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天有历史课♪\n老师今天会讲什么样的小故事\n给我们听呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aa7c796579282164ae038434abbeb96ed782fb10f41a9a846518e9ea593561f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d27992e4ae795c94ea793294",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伏特加小姐，这次的\n随堂测验对决赢了吗？\n……哈～……当老师真让心跳加速！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c853b465ee9cbb1c01a7f046cd94b70be344045d4a1805addd2b52d802633b6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1d28ed2b761c75f92c8a15d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，睡眠充足吗？\n过度的熬夜，对身体有害。\n必须要守护好您的未来才行哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d40a672e5127e3cc186895256ecf86175545fa6dc097901807d372534bb1d2eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef089041f8f1cc81b57ec9ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年，和莱茵的\n赏花之旅似乎还会继续。\n甚至明年，还有那之后……也许♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0263d4c66727db7e22f5eea8c5a427366ebc222c808accc521f1f5715d06cf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:033b837245e29220fd061b9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……想吃鳗鱼啊。\n白烧也好蒲烧也好……。\n土用丑日，不能增加吗……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dee4a9b057d584d3cd97c1ca261de7a77478794c5a2306867bbbbd0ca06e29a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fbb14a5394f24d8a1674420",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "橡子骨碌骨碌，\n骨碌骨碌～戴着帽子\n真可爱呢～♪……呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a61776a2ed207565f3b34c0d2454fa44272cdb6ef43f3c9f012f67333297266",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b077f28376c9d42da7a8d52e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……如果冷得难以忍受，请立刻\n叫我。我准备了\n10个左右的备用暖宝宝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d22e4efefc7241e8ca9b2000f9b05f8c7699613f2d8e92d04a4733ff7ca8580b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2c5223c1cdbc2935981aabf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣王光环小姐帮我穿戴时说，\n礼服要这样展示……\n对后辈的关怀也是一流的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a222caccdd45abec4871017d77bb2ca3c12032943b9a59ffa07f9d511daa4bb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58baa32b9474ce1a9c22ea94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要去陪同谋勇小姐进行\n深山闭关的锻炼。如果那是她所期望的话\n……我也想为她指明道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cc7aeb91ba9c2289d7ee01c7bd2141005eb5c8f3392d88d5ff9f855a67a7068",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8721d60f6f1021d384e509a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从高峰小姐的奔跑中传达出的，\n爱的片段。激烈到让心都要燃烧一般，\n却又充满慈爱……多么深奥啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11331e1e1e2e90281d0ea66794c1d1431a6d583a61acf6fb6e99ee40ff2953c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:105c5206b4df6b7741c9fe10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吉兆小姐，夸奖了我泡的红茶。\n是因为用了那个人喜欢的名水\n来冲泡吗？……呵呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a76234c04ed96af1e211ee0dba9d9242b80ba12990eb9e24fe28518c5b06ef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95315a691c99d372ef405d1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次，莱茵说要给我\n制作发饰。作为这件决胜服的纪念。\n……一定会成为宝物的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "707e84eb62b126a2d87ebe7f641552d3e3fce5f7818d2c959a5820778c8ed05f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a12339ca03d6d35ac09f63a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上散步的时候，孩子们眼睛闪闪发光地\n对我说好漂亮！……我成为那些孩子的光了吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d733b3ac32cd03feb910000e228da3ac5d9513f314412cf6565767dd8389c82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ce6a0fbd7521bd115f3d496",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "饭后的蛋糕，要来一份吗？\n首推是我们特别讲究的蛋白霜哦。\n……期待您的感想呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f960ce952ea2e568878923d31fda2d31038fd56753ce451bf7dc1f69cb7e7a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:734e572690bb7f3fedd55fa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡前的头发护理不能妥协\n……必须时刻保持配得上这层头纱的，\n美丽而纯洁的状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b88cfca14d13c0f13f2d1c62deb992a1abfc908d142164150ad54a0a9bd5234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77418cab334c5a409851d678",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵♪后辈送给我的\n樱花花束，真漂亮啊。\n……这是对我的感谢的证明吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "370afeb5770e542b4c41f51d928101109eb87890fa7a325d4fc0ccec7ff300ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fc122516f43d97b0a1fd676",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在和大家制定旅行计划。\n烧烤还有海水浴……\n种种体验都会成为我的食粮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50e7905865b17cdd36dede70a51b89ab0ca003e5cac58e5c9f9861961640edd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e9a39be1466fb92045cec31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一到艺术之秋，就会想念喜剧。\n舞台剧、电影、音乐剧\n……呵呵，选哪个好呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf0d74ce1aba1b1da3064480ab4627012cf8fc51be239ff1cc24ca2d809e819d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc908eed94a976adccf1538d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白银般的世界……如同充满可能性的\n未来一般，纯白的光景……\n心灵会变得安宁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7fe42001b42b0fef3bffd9e3bf5fe5ef60140e0ce5abfaba72593e515da2ad7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be35a89fc9137c5b42054b08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和风的装饰配上洋风的礼服……\n我会将两者都驾驭给您看。\n统以此二国，以此为更坚固的基石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a95c185f173f6f4cbad00c027fec3782e5a093526307498dbf7131ef566996a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:791b68098a5c6ceeb4922405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刻在裙子上的大河纹样……\n我相信身着礼服的我，终将\n抵达广阔的大海。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f99343fc9c7587ca05e25069c88832042aa73fcc9743474aadc785d0415e316",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efb6ebcf3927f911134a77a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯。蝴蝶结和腰带都很完美！\n……久等了，训练员。\n开始训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29f2a07594e851fae9bb129720342378767d3e5d3c033c2c184f98e5745df5c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b1d7003b5e82b54212c134e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力以赴",
      "source_fingerprint": "89447ee01225534fabc0fbf5686938e5d9856c972e535416afdf27eb3e1d1661",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83a69d8815ae35dca2082335",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正是因为被其他赛马娘认可，\n才有确固的基石……为此，\n训练才更要诚实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caaaacb041c31bf96077af6ab702e303e8b15c10467598236e6817e981447e4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68834e80ca99c4d1de17d71d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才，我拜见了\n特别周小姐的并排跑。……看到\n那位的跑姿，我的脚也跃跃欲试了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84309ae1aaf37e89a3f79345ba821ea81c88d9c5ec14a1eef79983c46a7b3806",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ee474dadfa56dab0490695a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……训练员？\n呵呵，累了吗？\n稍微休息一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc89f11d6b4dd4fb383df298bbc0719e5df816965927c8b7ccf2752bac4a87a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f3c0f7e8a741a8c986cca97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员。\n太勉强自己是不行的哦？\n……必须连未来的事情也一起考虑才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00a5730be6ba62dbdc8323bd65b5ea011540d59d2100246de1d8e4eb37aca4c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afe16a141207f06cd3ca61aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越是学习，就越能理解。您的\n菜单，连将来的可能性都\n纳入了考量……真是太棒了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb2273f8a77893465bf31533de83a093f4288fbd5addb927d19b68ab883a552b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd8c393b568acbcb13fe01a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员。改变了我未来的命运之人。\n今天我们要编织怎样的未来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26429bdea6a29abeb9d7cb2deb5cd3618c28fd46617667e5b73b0c6e5a184db8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3fca6273424625c34463fd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帽子，遮阳伞，防晒霜！\n阳光会削减体力，\n要好好做好对策哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "542504b05a6302d9798e4a4c42a40a5a8244269b30a98ed0f24bbc3ec2cb24f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b70cb6279c8bfed68f2746",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能共同抵达\n幸福的未来……\n我会依赖您哦，训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbf654de0d61c15a65d71bedc186d5ebad91d3c4b994663efb055ee2b4611e8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af1e7cd319f5352bbb8c862e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是什么样的训练，\n我都不会妥协。……为了实现\n铭刻在胸中的誓言。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9f5a3b7ada1f4fe57395b26b5135600a42752cb043bd655a012ae48970b123e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:944e14e92ce5a7f4a2e557f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果受挫了也没关系。\n只要怀着纯白的心，重新尝试就好……\n一起重视初心走下去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3b8e4f5892d77686e18222f39af04b45528006f0efa625e23d2725d2658ae76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87b3174692ab2589a0f88dd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "束带确任，头纱确认。仪容仪表\n要精心打理。……为了让这身礼服姿态，\n能被后辈们憧憬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2830a851b090a7dc0cd614ea36d41367452a50c81a147edb409e0114dcfab75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c7afeec1c0790d521069a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "共同鸣钟吧。\n愿这充满希望的嘹亮钟声，\n能传达到遥远的未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0991bbd47719c070ca0691bbc4064feaf1be67c1de8bfe26158122adaa7c5b43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69604f78d34993774a98aa05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是什么样的道路我都不会停下脚步。\n没有无法实现的思念……只要有您\n在身边，我就能如此坚信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71aa192832837d2a1cefa6ce35ad1b8c94002cb031e8b77f70ed381bbc42dc34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5feb96dcc2a2975ecf0e359",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到构筑起充满幸福的未来为止。\n与您编织故事这件事——\n我在此起誓。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6342859f8d6a46786caa9b5d1c26f377fc9851fde265316fcda4526091982c1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:173064c52f5a4c8f398725db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是与您一起，无论在世界的何处，都能战斗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "729f6db1e1cff1b227e0f4ae5039e4a2202fdeb68668db5b60778441c4fb1ac7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40123c7fdd5ad6c901642a93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这份思念也将，连绵不断。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41da0887819642691a85d12454550b76a464ffb9c2f88543ca5458f302969885",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673d3d8a4feb6723ec13fe4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我与您的故事，\n今后也会……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d0a87bc4511688888c08cdd1f6419e03c811b69974cfd8a0c012723916fcdec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77fac0e68ed6406fbf8e3e08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿这束花，\n能传达到未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47796ab71799c410f961cc2e33563d47830404592689dcd5deb77ef398d53233",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0637618026296e2b450da69e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如橡树一般坚强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aeb2f84019919e180718cc09fb3d8c0a0decf66995556cc7d8956365afd2fcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b8ddc56c2c6ea4e75be306b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，改写命运吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2785a77ab83f27790065aae263d6249aebd5c7b0ed4f2cbd0745d714fc5f5f2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2b8d076805d7cc7e9549cbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是西沙里奥。\n请多关照，训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8c9b0a6740499354a9a8a1572d0915ec353453075368199a48aee7b8e681ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3df281098c4e6e990bc45cd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿与我共同，成为基石吗。\n为了那未曾谋面的——未来的基石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c495190dc5e09bc3b6b4849547a06365e0e7012a98a3a5f6e818972cfd00f087",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a273a37c8f9f327644b13bc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "改良指导方法吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3282abf1f001d2067e5b3155df7df0c37f5d419665b270735496da43f0cff9a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f38a711e0f5a573958fefce1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请助我一臂之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e79ff6e4b72308c2fe12594d8204564069d86bc4a7cf8215e4c687cb662fe05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c9d07ff9289aa39288e6265",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "献上更多的祝福！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d9cf4e9ffed1a5b476a94e892561625048e10e6bed87a9809a45070a1aebb96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77261bedb39aac149d26a91e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条路没有尽头！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d4a109c2d95181b2fb78efaf8b9c142d949097e23b1a32cf24294d9e2be72fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d00345ba89656f7f1f28136",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条连绵不断的大河——\n您愿意与我一同前行吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abbed0894272946ae44f9548be96aa2a6fc0b6fa5f75b5e6380b14205ba98e30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1c58c631003b8468e88667b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是西沙里奥。让我们共赴未来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed8ba0c15ba32cbef91c73a82b79fdcc7f715217c9c65a9915a11b4ed8342444",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24de25543465744546fac856",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10d75e3fc5936a1264a118742ee8879f0bd608d88f86db003bc2a3fff32ca93b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0145b7d0b898423ff7cd1774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还请您助我一臂之力。\r\n为了证明由母亲传下、由我继承的东西――\r\n有多么伟大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7501e0d29d442417dd3334090cb0c999f2f08de44540a9387f88cdefd21b04cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c32f401d15f2ec91d1104a90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc4d55eaa4dc484db956d855",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5204aa8f0aea0d2a618fedb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕是不起眼的工作也默默努力…。\r\n能遇见拥有相同价值观的您，\r\n我感到非常幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70c43f232e262017b467af3d0fe62aa00e0a1edfd7fb3b4cdc0e60748bfa314f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab3e40c6a32580b319e27bc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近，休息日都是怎么度过的？\r\n那个……如果我们有共同的爱好，\r\n我想和您一起尝试。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e6f210b8ea08f179c5a1639fb737abc3312b9bfb2e5c2f87b9396f63ed30783",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:026d12d6ecc8c7c392696cd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年试笔的词定好了吗？我的是\n『积水成渊』。为了不忘这份心境，\n打算把它挂在宿舍房间里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8658e742a6965dda50d49ebf3696d37e50846fa7f596bd9ba1fe911e1adb2d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
